Maybe more realistic, count all monsters killed,
toward XP, and thus toward XL increases, but only
count the _first_ monster of each type killed,
toward the end-of-game score.

That would shift scoring heavily away from mass
murder, and focus it more around ascension oriented
tasks and acquisitions. It would partially decouple
the various "farming" mechanisms from the final
score, as a side benefit.


